ates the expression of GAP43 by stabilizing its mRNA through methylation and thereby plays an indirect role in neuronal differentiation (By similarity)."}],"uniprot_source":"UniProtKB/Swiss-Prot Function, release 2026_04","retrieved":"2026-10-21"}],"structures":[],"alphafold_accessions":[]}